        <p source="#source-7576-7675"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-7576-7675" corresp="#source-7576-7609 #source-7642-7675"><seg source="#source-7609-7642">――昭和四年・八月――</seg></hi></p>
      </div>
